        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "It started with a simple question",
        "text": "<p>Why is it so hard to find everyday care that is natural, honest and easy to choose? We asked ourselves that in 2019 — and started with a few products we already trusted at home.</p><p>Today our shelves hold skin and body care, herbal complexes, sprouted-grain superfoods and eco-friendly cleaning products. The rule has not changed: if we would not use it ourselves, it does not go in the store.</p>",
